<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  {% include "_seo.njk" %}

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Lato:300,300italic,400,400italic,700,700italic,900|Open+Sans+Condensed:300,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">


  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="assets/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/favicon.svg">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/tokens.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/base.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/layout.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/components.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/animations.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/pages.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/mobile.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div data-partial="loader"></div>
  <div data-partial="header"></div>

  <main>
        <!-- Introduction / owner story -->
    <section class="section section-masthead">
      <div class="container-wide">

        <div class="page-masthead">
          <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></nav>
          <div class="page-masthead-row">
            <h1>{{ page.titleHtml | safe }}</h1>
            <p class="lead">{{ page.lead | safe }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-intro" data-reveal>
          <div class="about-portrait">
            <img loading="lazy" src="{{ about.storyImage or 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=1200&q=85' }}" alt="Editor portrait" srcset="{{ about.storyImage or 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=1200&q=85' | srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 92vw, (max-width: 1024px) 46vw, 30vw" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="overline">{{ about.storyOverline or 'The story' }}</p>
            <h2>{{ about.storyTitle | safe if about.storyTitle else 'Triplipi began with a <em>simple frustration</em>.' }}</h2>
            {% if about.storyBody %}
            <div class="rich-body">{{ about.storyBody | safe }}</div>
            {% else %}
            <p>For years, every trip we tried to plan began the same way — searching the same five sites, reading the same recycled paragraphs, clicking through the same affiliate funnels disguised as journalism. We wanted something different. A travel platform that read like a curated guidebook, looked like a magazine, and behaved like a friend with local knowledge.</p>
            <p>So we built it. Triplipi launched in 2024 as a small editorial project — three writers, two photographers, a list of 60 destinations we'd actually been to. Two years later, we've indexed 450 places, partnered with 180 verified providers, and published more than 320 long-form stories. Everything else has changed except the original idea: depth over speed, and honesty about how we earn our money.</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission and vision -->
    <section class="about-mission" id="methodology">
      <div class="container-wide">
        <div class="mission-content" data-reveal>
          <p class="overline" style="border-color: rgba(245,239,230,0.2);">{{ about.missionOverline or 'Mission & Vision' }}</p>
          <h2 style="color: var(--c-bone);">{{ about.missionTitle | safe if about.missionTitle else 'To make travel <em>discovery</em> feel less like research, and more like <em>reading</em>.' }}</h2>
          {% if about.missionBody %}
          <div class="rich-body" style="margin-block: var(--s-6); color: rgba(245,239,230,0.85);">{{ about.missionBody | safe }}</div>
          {% else %}
          <p style="font-size: var(--fs-body-lg); margin-block: var(--s-6); color: rgba(245,239,230,0.85);">We believe that the best trips begin with the best stories. Our mission is to be the first place a curious traveller turns — not for booking, not for prices, but for the kind of honest, considered, photographically-rich account of a destination that helps you know whether you actually want to go.</p>
          <p style="color: rgba(245,239,230,0.7); margin-bottom: var(--s-7);">When you're ready to book, we connect you to verified partners — with full disclosure of every commercial relationship, every time. Our editorial team has no commercial pressure to favour any partner over another, and we publish our methodology openly. Slow travel deserves slow journalism, and that's what we try to make.</p>
          {% endif %}

          {% set stats = aboutStats if aboutStats and aboutStats | length else [
            {'value':'450','label':'Destinations indexed'},
            {'value':'180+','label':'Verified partners'},
            {'value':'320+','label':'Published stories'},
            {'value':'2024','label':'Founded'}
          ] %}
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-6); margin-top: var(--s-8);">
            {% for s in stats %}
            <div>
              <div style="font-family: var(--ff-display); font-style: italic; font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--c-gold); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: var(--s-3);">{{ s.value }}</div>
              <div style="font-size: var(--fs-micro); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: var(--ls-wider); color: rgba(245,239,230,0.6);">{{ s.label }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What we offer -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container-wide">
        <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
          <div>
            <p class="overline">{{ about.offersOverline or 'What we offer' }}</p>
            <h2>{{ about.offersTitle | safe if about.offersTitle else 'Three things, done <em>properly</em>.' }}</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        {% set offers = aboutOffers if aboutOffers and aboutOffers | length else [
          {'title':'A curated destination index','body':'Four hundred and fifty destinations — every one editor-verified or contributor-verified within the last 18 months. Organised across 100 careful categories. Every page includes seven sub-sections covering everything from season to landmarks, with original photography.','linkLabel':'Browse destinations','linkHref':'/destinations'},
          {'title':'Verified partner network','body':'180+ vetted package providers, hotel partners, and affiliate platforms — every one personally evaluated. We disclose our commercial position on every link, every time, with consent-gated redirects so you always know what\'s happening before it happens.','linkLabel':'View packages','linkHref':'/packages'},
          {'title':'Original photography & writing','body':'A growing archive of editor-shot photography and long-form travel writing. Available for licensing through our Shop, and free to read on our Blog. We take our photographs seriously, and we\'d rather publish less and mean more.','linkLabel':'Read the blog','linkHref':'/blog'}
        ] %}
        <div class="offers-grid" data-stagger>
          {% for o in offers %}
          <div class="offer-card">
            <div class="num">{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</div>
            <h3>{{ o.title | safe }}</h3>
            <div class="rich-body">{{ o.body | safe }}</div>
            {% if o.linkLabel %}<a href="{{ o.linkHref or '#' }}" class="btn-text">{{ o.linkLabel }} <span class="arrow">→</span></a>{% endif %}
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container-wide">
        <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;" data-reveal>
          <p class="overline center">{{ about.ctaOverline or 'Get in touch' }}</p>
          <h2>{{ about.ctaTitle | safe if about.ctaTitle else "If you've made it this far, <em>let's talk</em>." }}</h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom: var(--s-6);">{{ about.ctaBody | safe if about.ctaBody else "Whether you want to plan a trip, license our photography, partner with us as a verified provider, or just say hello — we'd love to hear from you. We respond to every message within one working day." }}</p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="{{ about.ctaPrimaryHref or '/contact' }}" class="btn btn-brand">{{ about.ctaPrimaryLabel or 'Get in touch' }} <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            <a href="{{ about.ctaSecondaryHref or '/contact#partner' }}" class="btn btn-ghost">{{ about.ctaSecondaryLabel or 'Become a partner' }}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div data-partial="footer"></div>
  <div data-partial="search"></div>
  <div data-partial="consent"></div>
  <div data-partial="lightbox"></div>

  <script src="assets/js/partials.js"></script>
  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
